#passage(("There is a Western narrative of Islam, and there is a media narrative of Islam, that tries to push people away from what Islam really teaches. Because if you have the Truth, people will oppose your Truth. There was not a single time in history where someone was standing for a good cause unless he was opposed by people. If you bring in the Truth, people will oppose you.", "Prophet Muhammadﷺ was born in Mecca. He did not receive Revelation until the age of 40. He married at the age of 25. His first wife was Khadijah; she was 15 years older than him. Prophet Muhammadﷺ didn't worship Idols; his people were Idol worshippers. He knew that God was not an Idol, so he used to go to a cave called the Cave of Hira, and he used to try to worship The Creator or meditate on God's existence. At that point, he had the first encounter with Angel Gabriel; it is not the only encounter he had. Angel Gabriel came to him and said: Recite. He said to him: اقرأ. \"Iqra\" in Arabic can mean two things: Read or Recite. He thought he was telling him to read, so Prophet Muhammadﷺ said: I cannot read. Prophet Muhammad's illiterate; he can't read or write. Then the Angel started reciting the Scripture (Al'alaq96:1), so Prophet Muhammadﷺ understood that he means: Recite after me; he doesn't mean Read. Then Prophet Muhammadﷺ started to recite after him.", "Then Prophet Muhammadﷺ was shocked, because you're having a supernatural experience with an Angel, and we don't see Angels every day! So he went back to his wife Khadijah, and then he said: Cover me! cover me! زمّلوني, because he was shocked, he was scared. Then she told him: What happened? He explained to her; then she told him: God will not do anything bad to you. You give charity, you take care of your neighbours, you do good things. She calmed him down.", "Prophet Muhammadﷺ was preaching the message 10 years in Mecca. He was being persecuted: they came and stepped on his neck when he was praying; they killed some of his Companions. A woman had a spear driven through her private part, one of his women Companions. His other Companions, they used to put rocks, and iron, and metal on them, burn them in the hot 50 degrees sun! They used to punish them, to persecute them; they used to do everything to them. Prophet Muhammadﷺ did not do anything. It was a peaceful thing.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Iceland Visitors Enquire About Islam! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xigQO8G9dOo", ((492, "8:12–8:28"), (515, "8:35–9:39"), (579, "9:39–10:09"), (628, "10:28–11:01"),), id: 2198)
