#passage(("It's in the Hadith: the first Hadith in Bukhari, who was someone who collected authentic narrations. كتاب الوحي, the book of Revelation: the first narration he puts is that narration. Prophet Muhammad did not worship the idols, while his people used to be idol worshippers; they used to worship the idols around the Kaaba. So, he used to go into seclusion. He used to go to a cave called Hira. When he went there, he's encountered Angel Gabriel. We don't say he kept coming back; we don't believe that. He came one time. He pressed the Prophetﷺ, because Prophet was terrified. Why was he terrified? When you see an extraterrestrial being, the natural reaction is that you're terrified. So, when he was holding him or pressing him, it was to make him firm.", "Then what Jibreel (Gabriel) said to the Prophetﷺ: he said اِقرَأ, Recite. Then, the first verses of the Quran were revealed. He said to him (al'Alaq96:1-5): ٱقۡرَأۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِی خَلَقَ (Recite in the name of your Lord Who created), خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَـٰنَ مِنۡ عَلَقٍ (Created the man from a substance, a leech-like substance, a leech), ٱقۡرَأۡ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلۡأَكۡرَمُ (Read, and your Lord is the Most High), ٱلَّذِی عَلَّمَ بِٱلۡقَلَمِ (The One Who taught with the pen), عَلَّمَ ٱلۡإِنسَـٰنَ مَا لَمۡ یَعۡلَم (Taught the Human Being what he didn't know). The whole chapter, the first chapter of the Quran, which is اِقرَأ (Iqra'), was revealed at that time.", "He went back to his wife. His wife was Khadija bint Khuwaylid; this was the wife he was married to before he received the revelation. Then he said to her: I'm afraid something bad is going to happen to me. She said to him: No, by Allah (Allah is the Arabic word for God), you are a person who's good. You give charity to the people. You help the poor. You're honest. You're trustworthy. Your people know good of you. Allah will never do evil to you. So he's calmed down. Then Jibreel, the angel, encountered him another time, and he told him that he is the Messenger of God, and that he has a Message to deliver to the people. Then Prophet Muhammad was given the command to deliver now, to preach. Allahﷻ said (alMuddathir74:1-4): يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْمُدَّثِّرُ، قُمْ فَأَنذِرْ (O you one who's covered stand up and deliver the Message), وَرَبَّكَ فَكَبِّرْ (and your Lord glorify Him), وَثِيَابَكَ فَطَهِّرْ (and purify your clothing). This is how things properly happened and how Muslims properly believe in Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “A Christian Testimony About Islam Part 1! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qLF3sGWkBek", ((222, "3:42–5:12"), (317, "5:17–5:52"), (357, "5:57–7:11"),), id: 2200)
