#passage(("I'll tell you why people use this age, this marriage to 'Aisha thing. People use it because of the shock factor, that's it! Because people today have been programmed to believe a certain thing when it comes to the age: the number 18 is the only number they see day and night; they sleep 18, they wake up 18. It's like you're 17 and 364 days, and 23 hours and 59 minutes, and it's a crime if anything happens! But one minute later, it's OK. What kind of logic is that? That is the western logic of today! So, the reality is, women are different, and their maturity levels are different, and it ranges from one person to another.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Confronts Muslim On The Marriage Of The Prophet! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vz1jgBpf8UE", ((966, "16:06–16:53"),), id: 2213)
