#passage(("And remember who's making these claims. You'd find Christians and Jews making these claims. Jews don't usually even make this claim, but you'd find Christians mostly making this claim. You see the age of marriage in Christianity, which is actually as the Bible explicitly says: it mentions things under even puberty. And then you have, of course, some people who claim puberty, which is all the way from 8 to 14 years old. They say the standard in Christianity is puberty. So, if the reality is this is the age in Christianity, what are you ashamed of as a Muslim, and trying to justify and be apologetic about?", "If someone is an atheist: today, we have the EPS files. I'm not going to say the word because of YouTube. We have the EPS files and we have all of these world leaders who are the real PDFs. You got these people who are defending these PDFs. You haven't seen a single protest in the West about these files that were released. Nobody is complaining. Some people making posts here and there, of course, if this is what you call complaining, but in real life there's no actions. This person was called George Floyd, who was killed: it's a complete riot, destroying places, whatever. Their leaders are mentioned, named in these files, and they do nothing. And these same people want to come to you and want to talk to you as a Muslim about this and that.", "You need to have knowledge. If you have knowledge, then you respond. The person is a Christian: I already told you what they believe in. Person is an atheist and from the West: these are their values. Someone will be like, \"Oh, this is not my value. I don't agree with this. I don't believe in that.\" When you think about a PDF, what do you think about? This is what you need to think about as a Muslim now. This is the most important thing now. I want you to visualize with me: when you hear this word PDF, this person is a PDF, whatever, what is the first thing that comes to your mind? Like the EPS files: people who used essentially girls, and they did these things, and then the girls, their lives are destroyed, and all of this. An evil person who's trying to do this thing to the innocent people. This is what you imagine. This is what you think in your mind.", "First, in your mind you need to make this distinction. In Islam, Prophet married Aisha. She was the happiest with the Prophet Muhammad. She lived 50 years or so after the death of the Prophet Muhammad. She only praised him and said good things about him for 50 years after the Prophet. You see what these girls are saying about those people in those files. You see how their lives were ruined and destroyed. This was a marriage between two families. You had Aisha and her father, and you had the Prophet Muhammad; you had her father Abu Bakr, which was his closest friend. Nobody in the community ever talked about this. It's a marriage. Prophet Muhammad was with the intention of marrying her, staying with her. Not these PDFs that are full of the Western life today that we see. So, first, when someone mentions this word to you, ask them: what is that? What is the PDF? First, identify what is this. What do you think about when you mention this word? And then clarify and explain: this is a marriage of the Prophet Muhammad.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Was Aisha 18 Years Old When She Married The Prophet? | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5lzZclwwqDg", ((325, "5:25–6:06"), (366, "6:06–6:42"), (402, "6:42–7:29"), (451, "7:31–8:33"),), id: 2241)

