#passage(("What do you mean, hundreds of thousands of people? I believe that all the wars that Prophet Muhammad participated in in his life, you can say that the death toll probably from 1 to 2,000 or something. Let's grant you 20,000, 30,000. What's this hundreds?", "Prophet Muhammad himself only killed one person with his hand. It's called Ubayy ibn Khalaf. And why did he kill him? That man came in the battle. He made an oath that he would murder the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam. So, the Prophet defended himself.", "\"Wage war against the entire world.\" Can you bring a source for this nonsense? Of course the Prophet didn't do any of that. Prophet sent many peaceful letters to the Persian king, the Roman king, the king of Bahrain, all of these kings, inviting them to Islam. King of Abyssinia, all of those people, saying that he's a messenger of God sent to the people. So, what was this \"wage war against the entire world\"?", "This is what Paul told them: I become to the Jew a Jew, I become to everybody whatever they want to hear. He says, if my lie brings righteousness or bringing me closer to God, why do you blame me? So, they can lie day and night, no problem.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Coptic Christian Warns The Western World From Islam And Muslims | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A_iaUx01FVw", ((1032, "17:12–17:30"), (1052, "17:32–17:49"), (1088, "18:08–18:25"), (1109, "18:29–18:49"),), id: 2280)
