#passage(("Can you give examples where he slaughtered people? You can give me an incident, and then I can give you the historical background.", "Prophet Muhammad was not going around killing people. When people say Prophet Muhammad killed, they usually talk about armies or talk about battles, or talk about issues like that, which we can discuss. The overwhelming majority of the wars that happened, let's say nine from 10, were defensive at the time of the life of the Prophet Muhammad. If you talk specifically about Prophet Muhammad, it was not offensive. The prophet is defending himself in Mecca and Medina from those people who are trying to eliminate him completely from that region.", "God doesn't need anyone, but God uses people as means to fulfill certain purposes.", "The thing about me is I'm a facts guy. So, when someone says the prophet did this, I give you a fact. If you want to say a prophet was slaughtering people, you have to give me examples. You have to give me instances.", "Yes, the blood is in your hand, but the question is: did that person deserve punishment? Are you saying under any circumstances you cannot kill another person?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Lantern | Arab | Sneak0 | Young Don | Warner | Discuss Religion”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCqP_UWikkY", ((3096, "51:36–51:42"), (3141, "52:21–53:18"), (3216, "53:36–53:40"), (3228, "53:48–53:59"), (3262, "54:22–54:32"),), id: 2282)
