#passage(("What happened to Jesus according to your belief? You believe that he was stripped and put on the cross, nailed in his arms and his feet. And when he was on there, due to the pain, he shouted, \"My Lord, my Lord, why have you forsaken me?\" I don't believe that Jesus, peace be upon him, went through something like that. You believe that he died in that gruesome way? According to you, it seems like God really, really hated Jesus. So, this is a very stupid argument to make. And what should we expect from someone that used to believe that he could control the weather?",), "Farid Responds, “The Prophet's ﷺ Aorta / Poison Argument [Response to David Wood]”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OrRGXi8-Pyc", ((308, "5:08–5:44"),), id: 2301)
