#passage(("This quote right here is from [Majma al-Bahrayn], where al haithami is quoting. So this report here is specifically by tabarani, and that's it. So tabarani here is the primary source, and then [Haythami] is the person that's quoting him. This is one narration.", "In this image what we have is again a secondary source quoting who was the first primary source in the image that came before this one.", "So what do we have here exactly? Well, Dr [Jalaluddeen] quoted one primary source and provided three other sources that are quoting that same primary source, then another source that relies on the same chain again. I personally don't know if he's that ignorant. I know that his sidekick is, for sure, and unfortunately his viewers are eating this up, thinking that this is some sort of amazing research.",), "Farid Responds, “Refutations 101 [Crash Course]”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CgfiwsD4Sns", ((538, "8:58–9:16"), (564, "9:24–9:36"), (648, "10:48–11:17"),), id: 2313)
